# Demonic Pact, "at the beginning of your upkeep, choose one that hasn't been chosen" (CR 700.2, 603.3c). Cast on turn 1 with two
# Mox Jets, Mox Ruby and Mox Pearl ({2}{B}{B}). Turn 3: 4 damage to Bot2 and Bot1 gains 4 (Bot2 16, Bot1 24). Turn 5: all four modes
# were offered but the damage is spent: it is refused (`! Bot1.Modes(1)`) and Bot1 picks "Target opponent discards two cards"; Bot2 discards
# two of its cards. Turn 7: draw two cards (the library goes down by that and the draw step's one). Turn 9: only "you lose the game" remains,
# so it is chosen without asking (`! Bot1.Modes`) and Bot1 loses (CR 104.3a): Bot2 won. Ruling 2015-06-22: "You read the whole contract".

